#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:5
#: d37cbf5928f54b0e9d753ffc2124b7d4
msgid "The Cube Purple Overview"
msgstr "The Cube Purple 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:12
#: d1ee80d850d548fca91290c863e20ddf
msgid "System Features"
msgstr "系统特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:14
#: 6db342ad90d24d98a196e2d27ec76a7a
msgid ""
"The Cube Purple autopilot is designed for ground based applications such as "
"boat, car or rover. Based on the Cube Black main module the purple is a much"
" smaller platform for applications where sensor redundancy is not required."
msgstr ""
"The Cube Purple 飞控专为船、车或漫游车等地面应用设计。基于 Cube Black 主模块，Purple "
"是一个更小的平台，适用于不需要传感器冗余的应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:16
#: 68e516f7f7b0420ab318f7ca96dcec8d
msgid "Single IMU sensor"
msgstr "单个 IMU 传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:17
#: 556a635462f74ab39f5cfde168695a43
msgid "Single Baro Sensor"
msgstr "单个气压计传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:18
#: d63e440c06194f01a312e1e840d048ce
msgid ""
"The entire flight management unit(FMU) and inertial management unit(IMU) are"
" housed in a reatively small form factor (a cube). All inputs and outputs go"
" through a 80-pin DF17 connector, allowing a plug-in solution for "
"manufacturers of commercial systems. Manufacturers can design their own "
"carrier boards to suit their specific needs."
msgstr ""
"整个飞行管理单元（FMU）和惯性管理单元（IMU）集成在相对小巧的外形（方块）中。所有输入输出均通过 80 针 DF17 "
"连接器连接，为商业系统制造商提供即插即用方案。制造商可根据特定需求设计自己的载板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:21
#: a425cee300074a4c9400f1fd2de75945
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "规格参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:23
#: 9e776435a973470cb6ac20b8697a1cb9
msgid "**Processor**"
msgstr "**处理器**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:25
#: d66cc53c25b747718a22307f718ce9ff
msgid "32-bit ARM Cortex M4 core with FPU"
msgstr "32 位 ARM Cortex M4 内核，带 FPU"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:26
#: 95d48c21e8d4442d8d6c162d68628671
msgid "168 Mhz/256 KB RAM/2 MB Flash"
msgstr "168 MHz/256 KB RAM/2 MB Flash"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:27
#: f21fd95457d5439abcc34a5b0aac56a2
msgid "32-bit failsafe co-processor"
msgstr "32 位失控保护协处理器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:29
#: bd97b597f94941d78e06381f0a17c84f
msgid "**Sensors**"
msgstr "**传感器**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:31
#: 615d6772cec742d39cb22ad80772c4af
msgid "1 x IMU (accels, gyros and compass)"
msgstr "1 x IMU（加速度计、陀螺仪和罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:32
#: 9012f2235d03497586b5a35496a6bae8
msgid "1 x InvenSense MPU9250 (accel and gyro)"
msgstr "1 x InvenSense MPU9250（加速度计和陀螺仪）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:33
#: bf6f6debc5684a778e1c7cf6d7ac868c
msgid "1 x MS5611 barometers"
msgstr "1 x MS5611 气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:36
#: 3851d93618eb41b2be943bd6230f8fc0
msgid "Carrier Board Mini"
msgstr "Mini 载板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:42
#: 7f957980b49b457a84a9ceba82dc2a58
msgid ""
"Mini Carrier Board has the standardized DF17 connector which allows the user"
" to connect it to every version of the Cube autopilot. With smaller size and"
" almost the same capability with the standard carrier board, it can better "
"fit in to those applications which have size limits. Also, it can be "
"equipped with the Cube Purple to better fulfil the requests from customers."
msgstr ""
"Mini 载板具有标准化的 DF17 连接器，允许用户将其连接到各版本的 Cube "
"飞控。体积更小，功能与标准载板几乎相同，更适合有尺寸限制的应用场景。此外，可与 Cube Purple 搭配使用，以更好地满足客户需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:44
#: 74543e568ca349b7aa5c32e44f68ce49
msgid "Functionality of Carrier Board:"
msgstr "载板功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:46
#: 44654943c92345d3a96a697ae0799abe
msgid ""
"Dual power input (for redundant power, automatic switch to another power "
"when one fails) Power distribution (limit the current at each connector, "
"avoiding overloading when one device draws too large current) Voltage "
"protection (over or under voltage protection, the circuit will be shut down "
"if the voltage exceeds the limit)"
msgstr ""
"双路电源输入（冗余供电，一路故障时自动切换至另一路）电源分配（限制每个连接器的电流，防止某个设备抽取过大电流导致过载）电压保护（过压或欠压保护，电压超限时电路将关闭）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:54
#: 583a448166be4bedb3c01a6bac55ef9a
msgid "The Cube connector pin assignments"
msgstr "The Cube 连接器引脚定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:56
#: b9a9128ed0cc4eb5b9b685bd48821419
msgid ""
"All other specification and external connections remain identical to the "
"original board as listed on the Cube Black page."
msgstr "所有其他规格和外部接口与 Cube Black 页面所列原始载板相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:59
